{"3910190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stout Kayak", "steam_appid": 3910190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stout Kayak</strong> <strong>is an actively developing game, playable solo or in online co-op with up to 6 players, immersing you in a physics-based extreme whitewater kayaking simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With online multiplayer and the integrated chat, Stout Kayak recreates the authentic river life vibe. Drive together to the put-in, ride the rapids as a crew, exchange tips and encouragement, and experience the shared flow that defines kayaking culture. Just like on a real river, the energy of the group turns every river run into a collective experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game emphasizes sensation, flow, and mastery over arcade-style or assisted gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a passionate indie developer, Stout Kayak offers a progressive learning curve that rewards practice and precision. It is aimed at players seeking immersion and realism in extreme kayaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully immersive open-world adventure where every rapid, drop, and wave is designed for spectacular freestyle tricks. Paddle through untamed rivers, leap off cliffs with daring drops, and explore secret caves in search of hidden diamonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Realistic kayak physics and dynamic water simulation.<br>• Surf powerful, dynamic river waves built for freestyle.<br>• Perform technical tricks: boof, flip, roll, and much more.<br>• Open-world exploration with dynamic weather and day/night cycles.<br>• Drive your truck to Upperlake or the dam, choose your river, and carry up to 4 players on board.<br>• Take on the Stout Race slalom challenge.<br>• Multiple cinematic cameras available for total immersion.<br>• Customize your style: change your kayak, jacket, helmet, and paddle with a variety of models and colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a calm explorer or an adrenaline junkie, Stout Kayak offers a perfect balance of relaxing atmosphere and pure thrills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your paddle, turn up the music, and get ready to tackle the wild outdoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride the Flow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Stout Kayak community:<br>Facebook: Stout Kayak Game<br>Reddit: r/StoutKayak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players, ask questions, share feedback, and ideas on the Steam community HUB!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stout Kayak</strong> <strong>is an actively developing game, playable solo or in online co-op with up to 6 players, immersing you in a physics-based extreme whitewater kayaking simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With online multiplayer and the integrated chat, Stout Kayak recreates the authentic river life vibe. Drive together to the put-in, ride the rapids as a crew, exchange tips and encouragement, and experience the shared flow that defines kayaking culture. Just like on a real river, the energy of the group turns every river run into a collective experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game emphasizes sensation, flow, and mastery over arcade-style or assisted gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a passionate indie developer, Stout Kayak offers a progressive learning curve that rewards practice and precision. It is aimed at players seeking immersion and realism in extreme kayaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fully immersive open-world adventure where every rapid, drop, and wave is designed for spectacular freestyle tricks. Paddle through untamed rivers, leap off cliffs with daring drops, and explore secret caves in search of hidden diamonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Realistic kayak physics and dynamic water simulation.<br>• Surf powerful, dynamic river waves built for freestyle.<br>• Perform technical tricks: boof, flip, roll, and much more.<br>• Open-world exploration with dynamic weather and day/night cycles.<br>• Drive your truck to Upperlake or the dam, choose your river, and carry up to 4 players on board.<br>• Take on the Stout Race slalom challenge.<br>• Multiple cinematic cameras available for total immersion.<br>• Customize your style: change your kayak, jacket, helmet, and paddle with a variety of models and colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a calm explorer or an adrenaline junkie, Stout Kayak offers a perfect balance of relaxing atmosphere and pure thrills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your paddle, turn up the music, and get ready to tackle the wild outdoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride the Flow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Stout Kayak community:<br>Facebook: Stout Kayak Game<br>Reddit: r/StoutKayak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players, ask questions, share feedback, and ideas on the Steam community HUB!</p>", "short_description": "Extreme whitewater kayaking on untamed rivers in a vast open world. Ride solo or online with up to 6 players, surf powerful river waves, throw physics-based freestyle tricks, send epic massive waterfalls and live the river life together. Ride the Flow!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/6fd96e4e49722a0c552406d028ec780fa388803c/header.jpg?t=1786480522", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786480522", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786480522", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Require